{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyday in nature is a battle for survival...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over what? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as either the Bear or the Salmon in this online 1v1 tactical experience and put up a <strong>selfish</strong> fight to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bear must catch the Salmon in order to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The salmon must eat all 6 flies in order to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strategy to plan how and when you as the Fish you will reveal yourself to the Bear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to surface to catch those flies eventually though...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May the best pond dweller win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/extras/160a3ae34a8c2d38645788243382f0de.avif?t=1763594409\" width=100 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1979490?t=1763594409","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/160587e66c37f56c7233aac32b0f894e0477e51a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763594409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/3132706d5754b86b4e6bba1e4e634e476576e005/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763594409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979490/3132706d5754b86b4e6bba1e4e634e476576e005/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763594409","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"des